          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mũthenya wa katatũ, mũthenya ũla waĩ wa kũsyawa kwa Valao, amavokea athũkũmi make onthe mboka: na ookĩlya mũtwe wa mũnengani mũnene wa mbinyu na mũtwe wa mũui mũnene katĩ wa athũkũmi make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
